# EXPECT-ERROR: stale or semantically invalid
module linear_proof_reused
lineage L_A
agent A lineage L_A
grant A effect externalAct uses 2 until 100
observe e by A content "event" confidence 0.95
endorse e by A threshold 0.90
authorize e by A for planning
proof pa access e by A
proof po origin e source A lineage L_A
proof pc clear e for A
proof pe endorsement e by A
proof pu authorization e by A for planning
proof p_use use e by A for planning from ["pa","po","pc","pe","pu"] mode linear
plan first by A using e effect externalAct requires p_use
plan second by A using e effect externalAct requires p_use
